WEBVTT

00:00:00.770 --> 00:00:01.730
I'm not going home!

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:05.230
I'll join your family and 
stay here with you forever!

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:06.940
Stay with me forever?

00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:08.820
That's right, forever!

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:18.200
Izumi, have you forgotten?

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.160
I'm in love with you.

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:23.530
How long do you think I can endure 
having you right in front of me,

00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:25.120
and keep myself from touching you?!

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:27.130
I'm not that strong a person!

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:35.500
Go ahead.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:35.840
Huh?

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:39.790
Do what you want.

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:42.350
I don't care what happens to me anymore.

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:44.810
So go right ahead.

00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:48.770
Okay, then.

00:00:49.220 --> 00:00:52.180
But I won't stop once I start, 
even if you start regretting it.

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:43.850
No...

00:03:15.570 --> 00:03:16.630
This isn't how I wanted it!

00:03:17.020 --> 00:03:17.960
Huh?

00:03:18.540 --> 00:03:19.660
Ryouma?

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:21.430
Don't...

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:24.640
Don't you dare mock my feelings for you!

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:25.850
Ryouma!

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:30.810
<b><i>Could This Be...</i></b>

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:33.770
<i>Why?</i>

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:35.980
<i>Why did he suddenly...</i>

00:03:36.910 --> 00:03:38.820
<i>Why did he suddenly get mad at me?</i>

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:44.490
I don't get it! Fine, then! 
I'm going back to sleep!

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:48.950
<i>But...</i>

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:51.620
Don't you dare mock my feelings for you!

00:03:52.630 --> 00:03:53.760
<i>Ryouma...</i>

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:56.600
<i>looked so hurt when he said that...</i>

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:11.480
<i>Am I a complete idiot?!</i>

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:15.650
<i>That could've been my 
once-in-a-lifetime chance!</i>

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:18.980
<i>Izumi told me to go right ahead!</i>

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:21.230
<i>But...</i>

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:43.030
What is it, Shino-san?

00:04:43.030 --> 00:04:44.590
I've been up for ages.

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:48.330
Okay, I get it. I'll be right there.

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:50.670
Jeez...

00:04:50.670 --> 00:04:53.520
She seriously has the worst 
timing in the universe!

00:04:57.570 --> 00:04:59.440
<i>That's Izumi's...</i>

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:12.910
I took the manga I was 
drawing to the publisher.

00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:14.790
And they...

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:19.080
said I have no talent...

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:26.340
<i>It's no surprise he's reacting this way.</i>

00:05:26.900 --> 00:05:30.180
<i>Anyone would, after having their greatest 
dream completely crushed like that.</i>

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:33.310
<i>I've got it!</i>

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:41.860
Ryouma-san! You're late!

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:44.910
Sorry, sorry! I got caught up in some stuff.

00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:50.340
We'll have to rush.

00:05:50.340 --> 00:05:51.290
Shino-san!

00:05:51.290 --> 00:05:53.370
What is it? Did you forget something at home?

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:55.870
No, uh... it's about today...

00:05:59.990 --> 00:06:01.070
Good morning!

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:04.300
<i>Sena Nagisa-sama</i>

00:06:01.070 --> 00:06:04.300
<i>It's been a full day since 
Izumi left the house.</i>

00:06:04.570 --> 00:06:06.500
<i>He hasn't called once,</i>

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:08.190
<i>and we have no clue as to his whereabouts...</i>

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:11.260
<i>Could something truly dire 
have happened to him?!</i>

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:12.970
<b>Traffic Accident</b>

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:14.680
<b>Kidnapping</b>

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:16.350
<b>Suicide</b>

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:19.440
<i>No... I'm letting my imagination 
run away with itself.</i>

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:21.490
<i>Keep it together, Rei!</i>

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:22.730
<b>Hasn't slept in 60 hours</b>

00:06:23.740 --> 00:06:25.640
Rei, what's keeping you?

00:06:25.640 --> 00:06:27.480
They're waiting to brief us for the shoot.

00:06:27.480 --> 00:06:29.450
Ah, yes! I'll be right there.

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:32.280
What is it? Are you texting Izumi again?

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:33.680
Y-Yes.

00:06:33.680 --> 00:06:36.400
He's staying over with a friend, isn't he?

00:06:36.400 --> 00:06:39.420
You don't need to worry 
so much. He'll be fine!

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:41.190
Yes, well...

00:06:41.190 --> 00:06:43.780
You're just too overprotective, Rei.

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:48.380
But it is surprising, isn't it?

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:51.420
Izumi's such a homebody,

00:06:51.420 --> 00:06:53.980
but he's been going out quite a bit lately.

00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:58.100
I guess that <i>Happy Wedding</i> commercial 
really was a good jump start for him, huh?

00:06:58.100 --> 00:07:00.320
Y-You think so?

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:03.000
Well, he is my and Seiya-kun's son, after all.

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:05.620
I was never really worried!

00:07:05.620 --> 00:07:07.640
<i>Forgive me, Nagisa-san.</i>

00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:09.740
<i>Your child has not been seen</i>

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:12.950
<i>since he left your home yesterday afternoon!</i>

00:07:14.070 --> 00:07:15.210
Is something wrong?

00:07:15.210 --> 00:07:16.490
N-Not at all.

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:20.410
Just one more... One more text, 
and I'll be right in.

00:07:21.410 --> 00:07:23.680
<i><i>If I can't get a hold of 
him by the end of today,</i></i>

00:07:23.680 --> 00:07:25.920
<i><i>I'll have to call the police...</i></i>

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:27.640
<i><i>Izumi-san...</i></i>

00:07:28.530 --> 00:07:31.070
<i>Please... please be all right!</i>

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:41.060
<i><i>Please be all right, Izumi-kun!</i></i>

00:08:05.760 --> 00:08:08.170
I must say, that look suits you.

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:09.510
Izumi.

00:08:10.020 --> 00:08:13.720
But is that resolve of yours genuine?

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:14.720
It is.

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:18.140
Dreams and hope are nothing but illusions.

00:08:18.690 --> 00:08:19.970
I understand that now.

00:08:20.970 --> 00:08:22.360
Precisely.

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:26.340
Pain and sorrow are the only 
real truths in this world.

00:08:26.340 --> 00:08:29.440
Only in Darkness may we conceal these truths.

00:08:29.640 --> 00:08:31.860
That is why I have decided

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:34.460
to steep both my mind 
and body in Darkness.

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:37.940
You're wrong!

00:08:44.280 --> 00:08:45.210
Lala-Lulu!

00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:48.910
Neither dreams nor hope are illusions!

00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:51.550
They are the light that 
illuminates the future!

00:08:56.580 --> 00:08:58.330
Izumi-kun, let's go home.

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:00.350
Everyone is waiting-lulu!

00:09:04.430 --> 00:09:05.510
I won't go home.

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:09.440
I've been hurt enough as it is!

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:10.770
I don't need the Light!

00:09:11.990 --> 00:09:13.310
Izumi-kun...

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:15.820
<i>Magical Scandal!</i>

00:09:22.610 --> 00:09:24.660
Perhaps you didn't hear him.

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:27.250
Izumi is here because he wishes to be.

00:09:27.610 --> 00:09:31.080
This is no business of yours, Lala-Lulu!

00:09:39.710 --> 00:09:42.610
That's... not true!

00:09:44.590 --> 00:09:48.550
Izumi-kun will not steep himself in Darkness!

00:09:49.510 --> 00:09:52.020
I believe in Izumi-kun-lulu!

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:56.110
That's what's so annoying about you!

00:09:56.350 --> 00:09:58.860
<i>Magical Kommentar</i>!

00:10:01.480 --> 00:10:05.250
Lala-Lulu!

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:13.170
I feel like I was having a really 
horrible dream just now...

00:10:13.850 --> 00:10:15.900
Huh? Oh, right.

00:10:15.900 --> 00:10:17.700
I'm in Ryouma's apartment.

00:10:17.700 --> 00:10:19.410
But wait—why is it so dark?!

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:21.150
Six o'clock?!

00:10:21.150 --> 00:10:22.970
How long have I been asleep?!

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:24.390
<b>GRUMBLE</b>

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:27.060
I'm hungry.

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:33.820
Ryouma isn't back yet.

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:37.070
<i>He must really be busy these days.</i>

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:38.490
<b>GRUMBLE</b>

00:10:39.880 --> 00:10:41.410
Let's see if there's something to eat.

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:46.440
<i>Izumi,</i>

00:10:46.440 --> 00:10:48.620
<i>I'm sorry for letting my emotions 
get away from me just now. </i>

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:51.080
<i>I put your breakfast in the fridge,</i>

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:53.380
<i>so please warm it back up 
in the microwave and enjoy.</i>

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:57.220
<i>Also, I finished washing your clothes. 
I've left them here for you.</i>

00:10:57.220 --> 00:10:58.200
<i>Ryouma.</i>

00:10:59.080 --> 00:11:00.300
Ryouma...

00:11:04.490 --> 00:11:05.720
Thank you for the meal.

00:11:08.870 --> 00:11:10.450
<i>Delicious!</i>

00:11:12.340 --> 00:11:14.230
<i>I've really treated Ryouma badly, haven't I?</i>

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:18.070
<i>I've done nothing but take advantage 
of his feelings for me,</i>

00:11:18.720 --> 00:11:19.700
<i>but despite that...</i>

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:23.160
Izumi, have you forgotten?

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:25.780
I'm in love with you.

00:11:29.340 --> 00:11:30.350
Go ahead.

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:30.710
Huh?

00:11:32.720 --> 00:11:34.160
Do what you want.

00:11:34.720 --> 00:11:36.670
I don't care what happens to me anymore.

00:11:37.560 --> 00:11:39.170
So go right ahead.

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:41.930
<i>I'm such an idiot.</i>

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:44.710
<i>I never considered how my 
actions would make Ryouma feel,</i>

00:11:44.710 --> 00:11:45.780
<i>and ended up hurting him.</i>

00:11:46.240 --> 00:11:47.490
<i>I'm a giant idiot!</i>

00:11:49.170 --> 00:11:50.340
<i>I should go home.</i>

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:53.950
<i>I won't take advantage of Ryouma
 any more than I already have.</i>

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:57.690
Oh! But I should finish the food he cooked!

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:02.950
<b>Like this!!                                  L-Like this?</b>

00:12:06.650 --> 00:12:07.870
That should do it!

00:12:13.720 --> 00:12:16.400
Housework is tough when you're not used to it.

00:12:16.940 --> 00:12:18.380
Is there anything else I should—

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:21.210
Oh, my phone!

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:25.100
<i>Rei's... probably really mad.</i>

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:29.510
<i>No, I've got to call him!</i>

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:35.280
Oh, yeah. Even with the 
power off, I still get texts.

00:12:36.640 --> 00:12:38.330
20 missed calls?!

00:12:38.330 --> 00:12:40.240
And 146 texts?!

00:12:40.240 --> 00:12:42.320
Are all of these from Rei?!

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:44.730
<i>Oh, no...</i>

00:12:44.730 --> 00:12:46.820
<i>I'm really... going to be murdered...</i>

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:52.680
<b><i>Izumi-san, are you all right?</i></b>

00:12:52.680 --> 00:12:54.540
<b><i>Please don't be down.</i></b>

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:56.600
<b><i>Please call me.</i></b>

00:12:56.600 --> 00:12:57.540
<b><i>No matter where you are or what time it is,</i></b>

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:59.060
<b><i>I'll come get you right away.</i></b>

00:12:59.600 --> 00:13:02.560
<b><i>Please, please, just call.</i></b>

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:04.240
<b><i>I promise I'm not mad!</i></b>

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:05.900
<b><i>Did you find a warm place to sleep?</i></b>

00:13:05.900 --> 00:13:08.310
<b><i>I bought your favorite cake!</i></b>

00:13:08.310 --> 00:13:10.060
<b><i>Are you eating meals properly?</i></b>

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:13.140
<b><i>If you're absolutely sure you don't 
want to go into show business,</i></b>

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:13.750
<b><i>that's okay with me too.</i></b>

00:13:13.750 --> 00:13:16.000
<b><i>You know how much all of 
us love you, don't you?</i></b>

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:18.770
<b><i>All I want is for you to come home safely.</i></b>

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:22.940
What is this? Why...

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:26.240
Why is he saying all these nice things?

00:13:28.710 --> 00:13:30.360
Rei's not supposed to be this nice!

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:34.210
<i>The truth is that I already knew</i>

00:13:34.690 --> 00:13:37.120
<i>that Rei was only trying to 
push me into show business</i>

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:40.000
<i>because he was worried about my future.</i>

00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:42.880
<i>And despite that, I...</i>

00:13:46.690 --> 00:13:48.300
Rei!

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:50.800
Izumi!

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:53.560
I'm so glad you're still here!

00:13:54.020 --> 00:13:55.300
I'm sorry, Ryouma.

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:56.810
I was thinking I'd better go home.

00:13:57.080 --> 00:13:58.770
That's fine, but take a look at this!

00:14:01.760 --> 00:14:03.200
My manga?

00:14:03.200 --> 00:14:05.200
Look at the other side!

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:06.240
The other side?

00:14:09.520 --> 00:14:10.910
Lala-Lulu!

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:12.690
Hey... Wait a sec! This is the real thing!

00:14:12.690 --> 00:14:13.730
How on earth...

00:14:13.730 --> 00:14:14.800
I got it for you.

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:15.370
What?!

00:14:15.720 --> 00:14:18.130
You said that Saotome-sensei, 
the author of <i>Lala-Lulu</i>,

00:14:18.130 --> 00:14:20.200
is your role model, right?

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:22.500
So I got him to do a review 
of your manga directly.

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:23.440
What?!

00:14:23.440 --> 00:14:25.300
Is that even possible?!

00:14:26.400 --> 00:14:28.440
Just who do you think I am?

00:14:28.440 --> 00:14:31.050
I'm the Legendary Ichijou Ryouma!

00:14:31.050 --> 00:14:32.510
R-Ryouma, you're incredible!

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:36.980
<i>Though, the truth is, it was 
actually pretty difficult...</i>

00:14:38.490 --> 00:14:40.480
What?! That's impossible!

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:42.940
Can't you do something? Please?!

00:14:43.160 --> 00:14:46.300
Today's schedule is completely 
packed until well into the evening!

00:14:46.300 --> 00:14:48.270
So no matter how much you ask, I...

00:14:48.270 --> 00:14:51.170
And we have no connection 
at all with that industry.

00:14:51.170 --> 00:14:53.660
Or with this uh, Saotome-sensei?

00:14:54.770 --> 00:14:56.520
Please give up the idea!

00:14:56.520 --> 00:15:00.340
The interviewer is already waiting for us!

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:05.520
This interview is at Kadoyama Shoten, right?

00:15:05.520 --> 00:15:07.760
Huh? Yes, it is.

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:09.130
For their fashion magazine <i>Jeje</i>...

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:12.190
But Kadoyama is also the publisher 
of <i>Monthly HIMIKO</i> Magazine,

00:15:12.190 --> 00:15:14.800
which serializes <i>Lala-Lulu</i>!

00:15:14.800 --> 00:15:17.470
<b>Kadoyama Shoten</b>

00:15:15.970 --> 00:15:17.470
Well, that's everything I need.

00:15:18.820 --> 00:15:20.700
Thank you so much for today.

00:15:20.700 --> 00:15:23.010
Thank you, and I apologize again

00:15:23.010 --> 00:15:25.480
for being late, and then having you hurry.

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:26.920
Oh, it's fine.

00:15:26.920 --> 00:15:30.200
Thank <i>you</i> for giving me such 
detailed, solid answers!

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:35.410
Ryouma-san! I was able to get you two hours!

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:36.790
Really?!

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:39.000
<b>Monthly HIMIKO Editorial Department</b>

00:15:39.430 --> 00:15:40.580
Please grant me this request!

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:44.190
I'm sorry, but... Today is <i>Lala-Lulu</i>'s due date,

00:15:44.190 --> 00:15:46.290
so our schedules are packed until late tonight.

00:15:46.650 --> 00:15:49.090
Give me five minutes! No, just one minute!

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:50.010
Please pass my message to him!

00:15:50.600 --> 00:15:52.760
Even if you say that, I...

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:54.220
Oh dear...

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:56.770
Please, I beg you!

00:15:56.770 --> 00:15:58.780
There's no need for that!

00:15:59.410 --> 00:16:04.260
<i>Getting them to pass my message to 
Saotome-sensei was the hardest part...</i>

00:16:06.280 --> 00:16:07.520
But never mind that!

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:08.610
Hurry and read what he wrote!

00:16:08.960 --> 00:16:09.860
Right!

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:12.710
<i>Although the skill level 
is not quite there yet,</i>

00:16:12.710 --> 00:16:15.160
<i>the passion behind this work 
comes across clearly. </i>

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:17.230
<i>It reminds me of myself in the past.</i>

00:16:17.770 --> 00:16:20.620
<i>The most vital thing for drawing manga 
is to gain lots of life experience.</i>

00:16:21.010 --> 00:16:24.240
<i>The artist is still young, so I would 
suggest he see more of the world</i>

00:16:24.240 --> 00:16:26.640
<i>and widen his experience 
of all sorts of things. </i>

00:16:26.640 --> 00:16:27.760
<i>Keep it up! </i>

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:28.960
<i>Saotome Miyabi.</i>

00:16:32.680 --> 00:16:35.060
<i>Lala-Lulu is cheering you on, too-lulu!</i>

00:16:42.880 --> 00:16:43.970
<i>The wind?</i>

00:16:44.400 --> 00:16:45.600
Izumi-kun!

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:54.170
Dreams and hope are the light 
that illuminates the future.

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:57.820
I'm waiting for you-lulu!

00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:00.280
Lala-Lulu...

00:17:16.860 --> 00:17:19.360
Thank you, Lala-Lulu...

00:17:25.130 --> 00:17:26.870
Saotome-sensei...

00:17:29.620 --> 00:17:31.290
Like I mentioned once,

00:17:31.290 --> 00:17:34.080
I faced so much rejection 
getting into show biz

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:35.990
that there were times when 
I wanted to give up, too.

00:17:37.080 --> 00:17:41.270
But, thanks to the memory of your 
smile from the first time we met,

00:17:41.270 --> 00:17:43.450
I found myself getting 
back up over and over.

00:17:44.130 --> 00:17:45.240
That's why

00:17:45.240 --> 00:17:47.270
I didn't want to see you 
give up on your dream

00:17:47.270 --> 00:17:49.700
after being rejected once.

00:17:50.220 --> 00:17:51.420
Ryouma...

00:17:52.010 --> 00:17:55.180
But that's just how I feel.

00:17:55.180 --> 00:17:56.670
The one who has to decide whether or not

00:17:57.440 --> 00:17:59.380
to continue from here on is you, Izumi.

00:18:00.130 --> 00:18:01.020
Yeah...

00:18:10.110 --> 00:18:12.770
I'll work harder!

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:16.500
I think I'd like to challenge myself 
by going into the entertainment world.

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:18.960
For the sake of my manga,
 and my own growth,

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:21.120
I'd like to expand my world and try harder.

00:18:21.570 --> 00:18:23.290
This is a big chance, after all!

00:18:23.290 --> 00:18:24.990
I'll make my show biz debut!

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:27.540
All right!

00:18:29.760 --> 00:18:31.010
Then, shall we get going?

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:33.170
Going where?

00:18:33.440 --> 00:18:35.040
You need to go home, don't you?

00:18:35.040 --> 00:18:36.360
So hurry it up.

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:38.720
But... are you coming, too?

00:18:38.980 --> 00:18:42.800
I'm guilty, too,  since I didn't call 
Sagara-san to let him know you were here.

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:44.720
So let's go apologize to him together.

00:18:48.410 --> 00:18:49.180
Okay!

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:51.980
And that's how it is.

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:54.000
We're very sorry!

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:55.150
I'm sorry.

00:18:55.790 --> 00:18:57.690
I-I...

00:18:57.880 --> 00:18:59.900
<i>He's really mad, isn't he?</i>

00:18:59.900 --> 00:19:02.120
<i>Probably madder than he's ever been...</i>

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:04.080
Izumi!

00:19:04.440 --> 00:19:06.540
Izumi! Izumi! Izumi!

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:08.390
Thank goodness you're okay!

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:08.390
Hey—

00:19:08.390 --> 00:19:09.000
Rei!

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:10.380
Calm down!

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:12.790
No way! He's asleep!

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:16.500
Yeah, Sagara-san stayed up waiting 
for you and didn't sleep.

00:19:16.500 --> 00:19:17.800
He was up all night.

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:18.780
What?

00:19:18.780 --> 00:19:20.080
Two nights, in fact.

00:19:20.080 --> 00:19:21.180
What?!

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:24.500
He really does dote on you, Izumi-san.

00:19:25.440 --> 00:19:26.410
Heavy!

00:19:28.220 --> 00:19:29.690
Ow...

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:32.190
What are you doing, Sotomura-san?

00:19:33.840 --> 00:19:36.360
Let's let him nap on the sofa in the office.

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:37.230
Um...

00:19:37.230 --> 00:19:38.190
Satou-san?

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:42.550
I used to do weight-lifting 
when I was in school.

00:19:42.550 --> 00:19:44.660
Satou-san, you're so cool!

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:49.170
Ryouma?

00:19:50.970 --> 00:19:52.030
Ryouma!

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:54.290
Wait a sec, Ryouma!

00:19:54.550 --> 00:19:57.560
What is it? You should go 
take care of Sagara-san.

00:19:57.560 --> 00:19:59.640
I was trying to make a tactful departure.

00:19:59.640 --> 00:20:01.150
He's fine.

00:20:01.150 --> 00:20:03.260
He's not sick or anything, 
just sleep-deprived.

00:20:03.530 --> 00:20:07.040
I honestly never thought he'd 
be that worried about me.

00:20:07.040 --> 00:20:08.350
I'm pretty surprised...

00:20:09.520 --> 00:20:10.510
I see.

00:20:11.840 --> 00:20:13.600
Then apologize to him again when he wakes up.

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:15.300
I will.

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:17.690
Also... thank you.

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:18.660
Sure.

00:20:19.120 --> 00:20:21.120
Not just for today.

00:20:21.120 --> 00:20:23.050
Thank you for helping me finish my manga, too.

00:20:23.460 --> 00:20:26.900
You bet! Count on me for coloring 
black spots and screentoning anytime!

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:29.100
You're really amazing, Ryouma.

00:20:30.220 --> 00:20:32.550
You came running when I was in trouble,

00:20:32.550 --> 00:20:35.270
you always treat me kindly, 
and let me ask so much of you.

00:20:35.690 --> 00:20:38.380
You even do things like get 
Saotome-sensei to review my manga...

00:20:38.640 --> 00:20:40.720
You're like magic.

00:20:40.720 --> 00:20:42.710
I'm not all that!

00:20:42.710 --> 00:20:43.630
You're just like...

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:44.970
...my big brother!

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:48.100
<b>Just Like My Big Brother</b>

00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:48.100
<b>He meant it as the nicest 
possible compliment</b>

00:20:46.760 --> 00:20:48.100
I-Is that so?

00:20:49.310 --> 00:20:50.850
<i>His big brother?</i>

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:53.790
<i>Don't tell me he thinks 
of me like that guy!</i>

00:20:55.000 --> 00:20:57.200
Well, in any case, I'd better get going.

00:20:57.200 --> 00:20:59.030
Oh, I'll walk you out!

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:06.140
Ryou—

00:21:16.970 --> 00:21:19.230
I'm not your big brother.

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:20.660
Take a good look.

00:21:22.270 --> 00:21:23.210
Later!

00:21:24.290 --> 00:21:26.130
Love ya, Izumi!

00:21:33.320 --> 00:21:34.290
<i>What...</i>

00:21:36.950 --> 00:21:38.060
<i>What is this?</i>

00:21:40.890 --> 00:21:41.980
<i>Could this...</i>

00:21:42.910 --> 00:21:44.530
<i>...be...</i>

00:21:47.600 --> 00:21:48.780
<i>...love?</i>

00:23:21.210 --> 00:23:22.130
You're hurt, aren't you?

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:23.140
Do you want to come to my house?

00:23:23.140 --> 00:23:24.040
Sure thing!

00:23:24.040 --> 00:23:25.040
Stop it, please.

00:23:25.040 --> 00:23:26.220
That's amazing!

00:23:26.220 --> 00:23:28.100
That's totally BL!

00:23:28.100 --> 00:23:29.660
It's okay!

00:23:30.970 --> 00:23:34.970
<b><i>Love Stage — Men's Style</i></b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Both guitarists in 
CRUSHERZ, the band 
I sing vocals for!</b>
